\":\"https://arkansasrazorbacks.com/12-hogs-named-nfca-all-america-scholar-athletes/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d193\"},\"ref\":\"d193\",\"snippet\":\" ... Callie Torres May\\ndate: 2024-05-23\\n---\\nBecoming a surgeon is a rewarding and challenging career that combines clinical and surgical medicine to save lives and improve patient outcomes. Surgeons are highly trained medical professionals who perform intricate and lifesaving procedures, addressing a wide range of conditions from ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.umhs-sk.org/blog/how-to-become-a-general-surgeon\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"155c3d895be6c7182f5d6e5e6779f4d6f0e24be39729a98c2a42e63adbd89357\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"5f82754ce6cb267e9c1086d1843aedf7a79a27bd867794ad6751ba7b5a4c45df\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Arizona Robbins Callie Torres marriages children\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_3fbf38eb2384484abb78d944"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d194\"},\"ref\":\"d194\",\"snippet\":\" ... Frank Gallagher\\nseries: Shameless (U.S.)\\ncreator: Paul Abbott\\nportrayer: William H. Macy Jacob DeMonte-Finn (young Frank)\\nfull_name: Francis Gallagher\\nspouse: Monica Gallagher (ex-wife)\\nchildren: * Fiona Gallagher (Daughter), * Lip Gallagher (Son), * Ian Gallagher (Son), * Debbie Gallagher (Daughter), * Carl Gallagher (Son), * Liam Gallagher (Son), * Sammi Slott ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Shameless_(American_TV_series)_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d195\"},\"ref\":\"d195\",\"snippet\":\" ... Shameless (2011-2021)\\n\\nThe 11-season saga of the Gallagher family, overseen by frequently sauced single pop Frank (William H. Macy), is consistently ribald but mostly grounded thanks to smart writing and a wonderful cast of supporting players including Emmy Rossum, Jeremy Allen White, and Joan Cusack. Much ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/tv/best-showtime-series/?srsltid=AfmBOope-ZKI9-YErJA7mjiYv84GJSSCOaH6O146Ow7n5iWDl_98oBF2\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d196\"},\"ref\":\"d196\",\"snippet\":\" ... On the South Side of Chicago, single father Frank Gallagher (William H. Macy) struggles with his addiction to alcohol and drugs, while his six kids — Sammi (Emily Bergl), Fiona (Emmy Rossum), Lip (Jeremy Allen White), Debbie (Emma Kenney), Carl (Ethan Cutkosky), and Liam (Christian Isaiah) — and his nephew ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/comedies-tv-shows\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d197\"},\"ref\":\"d197\",\"snippet\":\" ... Fiona Gallagher from Shameless\\n\\n25. Lorelai Gilmore from Gilmore Girls\\n\\n26. Jessica Fletcher from Murder, She Wrote\\n\\n27. Sutton Brady from The Bold Type\\n\\n28. Claire Randall-Fraser from Outlander\\n\\n29. And finally, Felicity Smoak from Arrow\\n\\nNote: Submissions have been edited for length and/or clarity.\",\"title\":\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/noradominick/female-tv-characters-that-inspire-us\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{