nterview that he had turned down TV series roles in favor of ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d202\"},\"ref\":\"d202\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2015, Rolling Stone ranked C.K.'s stand-up special Shameless number three on their \\\"Divine Comedy: 25 Best Stand-Up Specials and Movies of All Time\\\" list and ranked him fourth on its 2017 list of the 50 best stand-up comics of all time.\\n\\nC ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_C.K.\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d203\"},\"ref\":\"d203\",\"snippet\":\" ... He married three times and had a lifelong love of motor racing, once remarking, \\\"Racing is life. Anything before or after is just waiting.\\\".- Actor\\n\\n- Producer\\n\\n- Writer\\n\\nSteve Coogan was born on 14 October 1965 in Middleton, Manchester, England, UK. He is an actor and producer, known for ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?name=Steve\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2b32ff6e3b21a359d6e1c0551d9b602fadcc46a650b021d92c5ea58271c0b346\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"924f5b94a4da555a79bce694262668dd23abd12dd25af3f4925e6ce259b54507\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless character married three times children\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d200\"},\"ref\":\"d200\",\"snippet\":\" ... He will also join the cast of the 2026 Star Wars film The Mandalorian and Grogu as