eived\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d205\"},\"ref\":\"d205\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2003, Macy took home Emmy awards for his work as both lead actor and co-screenwriter in the real life story, and followed up by adding a welcome dose of comedy to the reverent historical film \\\"Seabiscuit\\\" (2003), the true-life story of the Depression Era racehorse ... \",\"title\":\"https://tv.apple.com/us/person/william-h-macy/umc.cpc.7b1nkihma1b8c4nsvopwk3o61\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d206\"},\"ref\":\"d206\",\"snippet\":\" ... A scholarship to the American Conservatory Theater brought him back West to San Francisco, where Hamlin's real transformation into an actor occurred in the Advanced Actor Training Program. There, Hamlin starred in a production of \\\"Equus,\\\" attracting the attention of director Stanley Donen, and receiving his M ... \",\"title\":\"https://tv.apple.com/us/person/harry-hamlin/umc.cpc.rvx67op1uk9d1zeyfbfejk3w\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"deb71b63d5b3de5da9d0d60366cccefbae99bf1c74a001c37b59c975d023fa63\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"bc130c55f5436f8bdd2044acd41ae1452799cb43a18612612c57a7827673ec86\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless cast real life relative co star\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f3101c068754499c81f225b1"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues more carefully. The combination of \"married 3-4 times,\" \"only one child survives,\" and \"real-life relative plays unrelated character\" is very specific. Let me think about \"The 100\" - Richard Harmon (Murphy) plays alongside his real-life sister Jessica Harmon (Niylah), and they're unrelated in the series. The 100: 2014-2020, 7 seasons. But Murphy's marriages/children don't fit.\n\nLet me reconsider. Maybe it's a show like \"Yellowstone,\" \"This Is Us,\" \"Outlander,\" \"The Walking Dead,\" \"Game of Thrones,\" \"Shameless,\" \"The Blacklist,\" \"Once Upon a Time,\" \"Supernatural,\" \"The Vampire Diaries,\" \"Pretty Little Liars,\" \"Grey's Anatomy,\" \"NCIS,\" \"Criminal Minds,\" \"Law & Order: SVU,\" \"Bones,\" \"Castle,\" \"The Rookie,\" \"9-1-1,\" \"The Resident,\" \"New Amsterdam,\" \"The Good Doctor,\" \"This Is Us,\" \"This Is Us,\" \"Outlander,\" \"The Crown,\" \"Stranger Things,\" \"The Mandalorian,\" \"The Boys,\" \"The Umbrella Academy,\" \"The Witcher,\" \"The OA,\" \"The Society,\" \"The 100,\" \"The 100,\" \"The 100.\"\n\nLet me think about \"The 100\" more carefully. Actually, let me reconsider the height clue. Height 1.65-1.70m. Let me think about specific actors. Let me search for the specific combination of \"married three times\" and \"only one child survives\" in a TV series.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The 100 Richard Harmon Murphy sister Jessica Harmon Niylah\", \"Richard Harmon height\", \"Murphy The 100 marriages children Emori\"], \"top_k\": 6}","name":"search"},"id":"call_2d9bc8a0b2c04233b261fbcd","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"TV series actor real life sibling plays unrelated character married three times\", \"actor plays alongside real life brother sister unrelated role series\", \"real life relatives co star same TV show unrelated characters\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_b6c3092a1bff4677ac962761","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in the third season and has been with Clarke on a couple of different occasions. Richard played John Murphy ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d207\"},\"ref\":\"d207\",\"snippet\":\" ... Raven and Shaw\\n\\nAppearances[]\\n\\n| Season One | |\\n\\n|---|---|\\n\\n| Episode | Appearance Status |\\n\\n| Pilot | Absent |\\n\\n| Earth Skills | Appears |\\n\\n| Earth Kills | Absent |\\n\\n| Murphy's Law | Appears |\\n\\n| Twilight's Last Gleaming | Appears |\\n\\n| His Sister's Keeper | Appears |\\n\\n| Contents Under Pressure | Appears |\\n\\n| Day Trip | Appears |\\n\\n| Unity Day | Appears |\\n\\n| I Am Become Death | Appears |\\n\\n| Th\",\"title\":\"https://the100.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Reyes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d208\"},\"ref\":\"d208\",\"snippet\":\" ... Did you know\\n\\n- TriviaDirector Jessica Harmon is the older sister of Richard Harmon who plays William.\\n\\nDetails\\n\\n- Release date\\n\\n- Countries of origin\\n\\n- Official sites\\n\\n- Language\\n\\n- Also known as\\n\\n- Peak Season\\n\\n- Filming locations\\n\\n- Production company\\n\\n- See more company credits at IMDbPro\\n\\nContribute to this page\\n\\nSuggest an edit or ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt20116668/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d209\"},\"ref\":\"d209\",\"snippet\":\" ... Martin Luther King Jr. \\\"ordered\\\" her not to quit the series.\\n\\n(Photo by CBS. Courtesy: Everett Collectio