e sits on the Executive Boards of LitWorld and the Education for Democracy Institute.\\n\\nFrancesca Murphy, Professor of Theology\\n\\nProfessor Murphy was formerly professor of Christian philosophy at the University of Aberdeen, Scotland ... \",\"title\":\"https://ethicscenter.nd.edu/people/advisory/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d219\"},\"ref\":\"d219\",\"snippet\":\" ... Avella\\n\\n- \\\"The Last Stand\\\" by Steve Deighan\\n\\n- \\\"The Book Club\\\" by Sarah Vander Schaaff\\n\\n- \\\"224\\\" by Ferris Jones\\n\\n- \\\"Madness For Two, (The Story of A Marriage)\\\" by Brenda Shoshanna\\n\\n- \\\"Orphaned at Christmas\\\" by Joanne Guidoccio\\n\\n- \\\"OUT AMONG THE DRAGONS\\\" by Dan Noonan\\n\\n- \\\"Hospice\\\" by Elizabeth Coplan\\n\\n- \\\"Spot Me ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.writersdigest.com/wd-competitions/announcing-the-winners-of-the-90th-annual-writers-digest-writing-competition\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d220\"},\"ref\":\"d220\",\"snippet\":\" ... After a tour of duty in Vietnam during the Vietnam War (1961-75), Jack practiced law in Calhoun. He later took a job as a foreign-exchange advisor with the Chicago Board of Trade in Illinois. His first marriage, to Judy Langford of Calhoun, produced two children, Jason ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.georgiaencyclopedia.org/articles/history-archaeology/carter-family/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"c18dc261882fb8403d5801aabe5ac38270c9318f9c01aabd9d647b445bdcbb11\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0df734a39838756edad09077321600d96049c250d0729fa2ef650bad15d469a5\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Murphy The 100 marriages children Emori\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_2d9bc8a0b2c04233b261fbcd"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... Actors who are siblings in real life are commonly cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... Second, it received backlash for casting a non-disabled actor to play the lead character, who uses a wheelchair after being shot in the line of duty.\\n\\nAnswer: Ironside - What character in the 1970s show Good Times, played by Jimmie Walker, was known for his catchphrase \\\"Dyn-o ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/classic-tv-trivia-questions\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... When a Real-Life Relative is recruited as a Time-Shifted Actor, to play a younger version of their older relative's character (parent-child relationships are the most common, but the trope also applies to nieces and nephews, or younger cousins and siblings).\\n\\n- All-Star Cast: A ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CharactersAndCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d221\"},\"ref\":\"d221\",\"snippet\":\" ... Supporting Actor in 2009 just over a year after his death, becoming just the second person to win a posthumous acting Oscar?\\n\\nAnswer: Heath Ledger - David Brent was played by Ricky Gervais in the 2001-2003 British version of an iconic mockumentary TV series, but who played his ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watercoolertrivia.com/trivia-questions/2000s-pop-culture-trivia\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d92\"},\"ref\":\"d92\",\"snippet\":\" ... actors in completely unrelated roles in TV shows can go unnoticed by the audience, like Charles-Dean Chapman in Game of Thrones.\\n\\n- Talented actors, such as Tatiana Maslany in Orphan Black and Lisa Kudrow in Friends, can successfully portray multiple characters and create complex relationships on-screen.\\n\\nPlaying ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/actors-multiple-characters-same-tv-show/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d93\"},\"ref\":\"d93\",\"snippet\":\" ... What makes the show truly worthy of all-time-best status is the coming-of-age storylines, the portrayal of magical childhood friendships, the carefully crafted Spielbergian aesthetic, the sentimental depiction of suburban Midwestern life, the detailed character studies brought to life by kids who seem like real ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rd.com/list/teen-tv-shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d222\"},\"ref\":\"d222\",\"snippet\":\" ... Apple TV+ on August 14, 2020, with the first three episodes were released at the same time. A second season of 12 episodes followed on July 23, 2021, with the third season released on March 15, 2023. It was announced in March 2025 that the series has been ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ted_Lasso\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... and Helen Slater play teenage siblings. With their blond hair, grey-blue eyes, peaches-and-cream complexions, and identical last names, coupled with the fact that both actors were relative unknowns at the time, it was unsurprising when many moviegoers assumed they were real-life brother-and-sister ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"18db6f69bf65d4ddcd78468b655ce4dae3b644fe03f34d582d6c198c2558d08c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"514f77752f77f38194e2a3c1a1bb98f137794af3ceefcfc16c7385e1cfd83226\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"TV series actor real life sibling plays unrelated character married three times\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d18\"},\"ref\":\"d18\",\"snippet\":\" ... Slater play teenage siblings. With their blond hair, grey-blue eyes, peaches-and-cream complexions, and identical last names, coupled with the fact that both actors were relative unknowns at the time, it was unsurprising when many moviegoers assumed they were real-life brother-and-sister.\\n\\n- The Lord ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SeparatedAtBirthCasting\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d90\"},\"ref\":\"d90\",\"snippet\":\" ... Any family relation is played by the same actor.\\n\\n- You Look Familiar: One actor plays two unrelated characters, within the same series, but (usually) different episodes.\\n\\nExamples:\\n\\nFor works that have their own pages:\\n\\n- Anime\\n\\n- Video Games\\n\\n- Western Animation\\n\\n- Futari wa Pretty Cure Splash★Star:\\n\\n- Yuriko Fuchizaki plays ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/ActingForTwo\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\" ... Crowe will play the role of one of Kaczynski's Harvard professors, Henry Murray.\\n\\nRussell Crowe lands a featured role on Netflix's Unabom\\n\\nThe movie is based on real-life events, and Murray subjected Kaczynski to controversial psychological experiment, which likely led to his later-life actions ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3758542/news/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d223\"},\"ref\":\"d223\",\"snippet\":\" ... a lead role in the 2002 syndicated television series, Kelly's Dream Club, in which Barbie appeared in a supporting role. Since then, they appeared as main characters in media adaptations of the franchise, including Barbie: Life in the Dreamhouse and the Barbie & Her Sisters in... film entries ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Barbie%27s_friends_and_family\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d166\"},\"ref\":\"d166\",\"snippet\":\" ... The actor was 80 when he passed away at his home, his rep, Jennifer Craig, told TMZ.\\n\\nThe longtime actor played Leon Carp in 46 episodes of \\\"Roseanne.\\\" He was also a series regular on \\\"Sabrina the Teenage Witch,\\\" and had a recurring role on \\\"Two and a ... \",\"title\":\"https://pagesix.com/celebrity-news/celebrity-deaths-2024/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d171\"},\"ref\":\"d171\",\"snippet\":\" ... Sarandon made her Broadway debut in the play An Evening with Richard Nixon (1972). She returned to Broadway in the 2009 revival of Exit the King. On television, she had guest roles on the sitcoms Friends (2001) and Malcolm in the Middle (2002) as well as starring roles ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Susan_Sarandon\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d224\"},\"ref\":\"d224\",\"snippet\":\" ... some real-life brothers and sisters appearing together on the big screen, whether they're keeping with the theme and playing siblings or simply popping in for a quick cameo. From the Fannings to the Wilsons to the Murphys, here are 32 times celebrity siblings acted alongside each ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cinemablend.com/movies/times-real-siblings-showed-up-in-the-same-movie\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d225\"},\"ref\":\"d225\",\"snippet\":\" ... alongside her sister in \\\"The Flight Attendant,\\\" among other roles.\\n\\nRyan's older sister Mandi, who he often brings to red carpet events, is a producer.\\n\\nZac Efron has a younger brother named Dylan, who he often brings to award shows and NBA games.\\n\\nSienna is an actor ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.popsugar.com/celebrity/celebrities-siblings-pictures-36093166\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_rou